  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed dwelling, by virtue of its siting, scale and design, would create a visually prominent feature comprimising the opennness of the plot and failing to respect the established character of the existing dwelling and distinctive symmtrical design of the corner set-piece resulting in a discordant and fragemented addition which undermines the architectural integrity of this distinctive built form,&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;materially and detrimentally harming the appearance and historical character of the site and surrounding area.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;As such, this development is considered to be unacceptable and contrary to&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;:Paragraphs 131, 135 and 203 of the National Planning Policy Framework (NPPF) (December 2023)Policies D4 and HC1 of the London Plan (March 2021)Policices SP2, DMD1, DMD4 and Part 6 of SPP6 of the LBBD Local Plan (September 2024)&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
